        <mxCell id="_x0" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1F4E79&quot;&gt;FOUR LAYERS OF CONTROL&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;L1&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Authentication: Entra ID SSO. No local accounts.&lt;br&gt;L2&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;App access: AD group CRO-Handlers, enforced&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; at API Gateway before any code runs.&lt;br&gt;L3&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Claim access: API Lambda compares the ENT#&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; item for the caller with the CLAIM# item.&lt;br&gt;L4&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Audit: every allow / deny decision is logged.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1F4E79&quot;&gt;FLOW&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Handler signs in through Cognito&lt;br&gt;2&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Cognito federates to Entra ID (OIDC)&lt;br&gt;3&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Token returned to the SPA (sub, groups)&lt;br&gt;4&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Every API call carries the JWT&lt;br&gt;5&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Authorizer verifies signature, expiry, group&lt;br&gt;6&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Request reaches API Lambda with user identity&lt;br&gt;7&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Lambda reads CLAIM# and ENT#, applies rule&lt;br&gt;8&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Decision and summary version logged&lt;br&gt;A&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Role product changes captured like claims&lt;br&gt;B-D Same ingest path; ENT# items upserted&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1F4E79&quot;&gt;L3 RULE (configurable, Parameter Store)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Allow when any of:&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;user is the assigned adjuster / supervisor&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;user LOB and office match the claim&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;user role has secured-claim access, if secured&lt;br&gt;Otherwise 403; the claim number is not confirmed&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;to exist (no enumeration).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1F4E79&quot;&gt;PILOT SIMPLIFICATION&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;If all CRO-Handlers may read all flagged claims,&lt;br&gt;L3 collapses to &quot;ENT# exists&quot;; schema unchanged,&lt;br&gt;so tightening later is a rule change, not a rebuild.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1F4E79&quot;&gt;FRESHNESS&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Entitlements lag Snowflake by the feed latency&lt;br&gt;(5 to 25 min). Revocations also come via Entra:&lt;br&gt;removing the AD group cuts access immediately.&lt;br&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#9AA5B1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;fontSize=11;fontColor=#222222;fontFamily=Arial;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1310" y="120" width="360" height="600" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
